pi-wasm-kit is an independent project by leepokai.

Inspired by Finn Voorhees's PiDurableKit:
https://github.com/finnvoor/PiDurableKit
PiDurableKit demonstrates embedding Pi Durable in a host runtime with native
capability bridges and an idiomatic API. This project applies that approach to
QuickJS WebAssembly and JavaScript hosts. No affiliation or endorsement is implied.

Powered by Earendil Works' Pi Durable, Pi AI, and Chord (MIT), and
QuickJS / quickjs-emscripten (MIT). Upstream runtime code is bundled at build time,
not reimplemented. Third-party license texts are distributed in dist/licenses.
